            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch wondered whether the Court was collapsing two separate due\u2011process inquiries\u2014purposeful availment and fundamental fairness\u2014into a single test."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
