              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "There are 575 out\u2011of\u2011State plaintiffs from 33 states involved in the litigation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Neal K. Katyal",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "683eb00c0f04c4806dc7d213a9e25146827e6b39f8913db6056acc28fce3f40d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-683eb00c0f04-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Neal K. Katyal, the California Supreme Court previously ruled that plaintiffs who were not prescribed the drug in California, did not take it in California, and had no other connection to California could still sue there."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Neal K. Katyal",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "683eb00c0f04c4806dc7d213a9e25146827e6b39f8913db6056acc28fce3f40d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-683eb00c0f04-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that this California rule would distribute the burden of defending mass\u2011tort claims in an uneven way."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Goldstein",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "683eb00c0f04c4806dc7d213a9e25146827e6b39f8913db6056acc28fce3f40d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-683eb00c0f04-0002-0003",
              "ev-683eb00c0f04-0002-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The California court is providing a forum to adjudicate a claim about the lawfulness of BMS\u2019s design, manufacturing and distribution of the drug Plavix, activities that occurred in New\u202fJersey, not California."
      }
    ],
